<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/memento-mori> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "mindfulness of death" .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/memento-mori> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "remembering death" .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/memento-mori> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/death-awareness> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/memento-mori> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The deliberate, regular practice of remembering that you will die and do not know when, used not to dwell on death but to see more clearly what deserves your time, attention and care today." .
